' Accounts v0: the Website account page, as a low-fidelity wireframe.
' Grey sections are later steps, shown so the page has room for them.
' Render: plantuml -tsvg dg-accounts-v0-account-page.puml
@startuml
title Accounts v0: Website account page (wireframe)
salt
{+
{ **Discourse Graphs** | . | . | . | Signed in as Alice Martin | [Sign out] }
==
{ **Profile** }
{
  Name | "Alice Martin        " | [Save]
  Email | alice@example.org | <color:#666>hidden from other people
}
<color:#666>In v0 your work shows the name each platform knows you by, not this profile name.
--
{ **Ways to log in** }
{#
  Method | Detail | .
  Password | set | [Change]
  Google | alice@example.org | [Unlink]
  GitHub | not linked | [Link]
}
--
{ **Connected platform accounts** }
{#
  Platform | Account | Space | Reaches | .
  Roam | Alice Martin | lab-graph | this space only | [Disconnect]
  Obsidian | vault notes-a1b2 | notes | this space only | [Disconnect]
}
<color:#666>To reach another space, open the plugin there and click Connect.
--
{ **What you can reach** }
{T
 + lab-graph (Roam): read and write
 ++ group holt-matsu-sharing: read; admin, through lab-graph
 + notes (Obsidian): read and write
}
==
{ <color:#999>**Later steps** }
{
  <color:#999>Delete account | <color:#999>first step after v0
  <color:#999>Sessions and devices: sign out one, or everywhere | <color:#999>after v0
  <color:#999>MCP connections that act as you | <color:#999>after v0
  <color:#999>Who sees which profile fields | <color:#999>after v0
}
}
@enduml

